presenting-html-plans
---------------------

Adapted from `skills/presenting-html-plans` in
https://github.com/CSRessel/nori-profile-clifford at commit
70f6d3ed389f8005185c10fc4b64595642a73d5f. Its history replaced a snapshot of
Builder.io's Agent Native `visual-plan` workflow; Builder.io remains credited
for that preceding workflow and concept. The local scaffold in this repository
has been independently hardened with content sanitization, a restrictive CSP,
pinned browser dependencies, and constrained source selection.

